  (text "Jacks: Rean/Neutrik NRJ6HF stereo 6.35 mm PCB jacks, mounted on the board edges (noses out).\nPiezo: mono guitar cable (TIP = signal, SLEEVE = GND).  Hi-hat pedal: stereo cable, TIP = pot wiper, RING = VCC.\nPower: 9 V DC (center +) -> 1N5819 -> VIN, or USB only." (at 116.84 22.86 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 1f32b717-27cd-4b55-bbe4-74acd55c55ca))
